  "decision_conditions": [
    "The proposed rear extension, by reason of its height, design, mass, bulk and siting, would create undue sense of enclosure that would be dominant and overbearing to the detriment of the neighbour amenity of occupants at Nos.12 and 14 Lancaster Place. The proposal is therefore contrary to policy LP8 of the adopted Local Plan (2018), Policy 46 of the Publication Local Plan, Policy D4 of the London Plan (2021), and the SPD for House Extensions and External Alterations (2015)."
